  "title": "CMake: Add GLOBAL_PROFILE_DATA_DIR option to customize profiles for installation",
  "description": "GLOBAL_PROFILE_DATA_DIR has been added to specify where the global profile directory will draw from and be used for installation.  It is expected to be an absolute (not relative) path so it can work outside of the Wireshark repository\n\nAdded equivalent functionality for Stratoshark (STRATOSHARK_GLOBAL_PROFILE_DATA_DIR)\n\nPing #18223\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
