          "id": 3199874809,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "What about an environment variable to set the global profile data dir runtime?\nOr a preference (advanced) to change it?\nOr an option to configure a third profile data dir?",
          "author": {
            "id": 4753670,
            "username": "stigbjorlykke",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Stig Bjørlykke",
            "state": "active",
